                              |GKBMONK RANKS
|YK0================================================================

|YKB'If an inexperienced one has no idea who the wise are, the
entire Order will die.'|WKO - |RKBMistress Jin Lotus|WKO

|YKOA Monk, unlike the other professions of Darkwind only learns
new skills upon progression through the ranks. To advance in
rank a Monk must achieve the required guild level and defeat
a challenge master.  The ranks have the following titles
Initiate, Disciple, Master of the East Wind,
Master of the South Wind, Master of the West Wind, Master of
the North Wind, Master of Autumn, Master of Winter, Master of
Spring, Master of Summer, and Grand Master.

